WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.080
¿Qué diablos fue eso, Charlotte?

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:04.000
How dare you talk

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.800
to my business partner like that?

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.400
What do you think you're doing?

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.600
What do I think I'm doing?

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.880
What do you even know about me?

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:12.640
You've made my job unbearable!

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:13.920
Now you're dragging my family

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:14.760
into it!

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:15.640
Your family?

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:16.840
Exactly!

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:18.960
That's what I'm saying.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.480
You know nothing about me and—
